function aggregate(){
  var rows = matching(); 
  var xv = axisVals(state.x), yv = axisVals(state.y);
  var cnt = zeros, sum = zeros, n matrix dims [yv.length][xv.length];
  rows.forEach(r => { i=axisIndex(y...), j=axisIndex(x...); cnt[i][j]++; sum[i][j]+= (measure dim value) });
  return {xv, yv, cnt, avg, total: rows.length};
}
```
Measure cell value: count or avg → cell display: if avg, show avg value (2 dec or dec per dim) + tooltip "n=…"; heat by value/max.

Color: heat(v, max): t=v/max; interpolate between c0 (#132743) and c1 (#43d9c2)? Let me pick a tasteful sequential ramp on dark bg (teal→light). Steps: use 7 quantized levels for cleaner look. Text color: t>0.55 ? dark : light.

Cells: display count always as primary (small), if measure avg → show avg bigger. Actually measure=count → big count; measure=avg → big avg, small "n=X". Margins: row/col totals + overall.

renderCanvas: build HTML string. Add colgroup. Include header corner with "Y \ X" labels + measure selector (select#measureSel: 计数 / 平均:each quant dim) — measure select commits with source "投影画布 · 度量切换".

Cell click → drill:
```js
function drillCell(yi, xj){
  var xVal = xv[xj], yVal = yv[yi]; // cat string or bin obj
  build filters for both dims (if not already exactly this) with action '下钻单元格 ...'
}
```
For quant bin: range lo/hi. Merge: if filter for that dim already exactly equals target → skip adding (but still add the other). Attribution action: '下钻 ['+xlabel+' × '+ylabel+']', source '投影画布 · 单元格点击'.

Only commit once (single commit covering both filter updates) → one trail entry.

renderRail: two group sections. Each dim item:
```
<div class="dim {active-x/active-y}">
  <div class="dim-head" data-dim>
    <button class="ax" data-axis="x">X</button><button class="ax" data-axis="y">Y</button>
    <span class="dim-name">label</span> <span class="badge">类|量</span>
    <button class="funnel">FILTER ICON ▾</button>
  </div>
  <svg class="spark">bars</svg>  (static distribution)
  <div class="dim-filter"></div> (expanded editor when open)
  chips of active filter for this dim
</div>
```
Filter editor: cat → value checkboxes w/ counts (under current other filters? use full counts for simplicity but indicate matching count under current filter set... simpler: global counts) + 清除; quant → min/max number inputs + 应用/清除.
Expansion state: UI state (not committed) `uiOpen = {dimId: bool}`.

setAxis(axis, dim):
```js
function setAxis(axis, dim){
  if(axis==='x'){ if(state.y===dim){ swap } ... }
  commit('换轴 '+axis.toUpperCase()+' → '+DIM[dim].label, '维度轨 · 点击', ()=>{
    if(axis==='x'){ if(state.y===dim) state.y=state.x; state.x=dim; } else { if(state.x===dim) state.x=state.y; state.y=dim; }
  });
  toast('维度已切换 · 过滤 '+state.filters.length+' 项 / 聚焦 / 轨迹全部保留');
}
```
Wait — commit() runs mutate then renderAll; toast after commit — but state already updated; toast text reads new filters count. But toast should convey persistence: show BEFORE count = AFTER count. Since nothing else changed, same. Fine — but capture before: var n = state.filters.length before commit... commit mutates only axes so n same. Simplify: show after.

renderAnchor chips:
```
投影 [X 发现方法 × Y 平衡温度] · 度量 计数 · 过滤 2 · 聚焦 TOI-237 · 轨迹 5/9 · 匹配 412/600
```
Each chip: label+value, title attribute explains 归属/保持契约: e.g. title="跨维度切换保持不变". Filter chip row: actually put ACTIVE FILTER chips in anchor bar too? The anchor bar is "constant across switches" — filters ARE part of it. Add chips for each filter with × remove and tooltip attribution: title="归属: 下钻单元格 [..] · 20:31:05"。 Yes — filters get "归属可见" in the anchor bar directly. 

renderRecords: header + count + rows (name, class badge, temp, dist, esi). Limit 80, footer if truncated. Row click focus.

renderTrail: header with ↶ ↷ ⤺(回到初始) buttons. List entries newest first: seq, action, source, time; class 'current' on tIndex; click → timeTravel. Entry also shows filter/focus counts in that snapshot? Keep action+source+time.

renderInspector: if focus record: table of all 10 dims values; 落点 line: X val + Y val (bin label for quant); note "切换投影后落点随当前轴更新"; button 清除聚焦. Else guidance: "在记录列表或画布中点击任意行星以聚焦；聚焦会跨维度切换保持。"

Keyboard: document keydown: ctrl+z undo (preventDefault), ctrl+shift+z / ctrl+y redo.

Toast: div, showToast(msg): set text, hidden=false, class show, clearTimeout, setTimeout hide 1800ms.

Empty state: if aggregate total===0 → canvas shows empty message + "清除全部过滤" button (commit each filter removal? one commit removing all: action '清除全部过滤', source '空状态 · 一键恢复'). 

Error state: harness only (no real error paths in-app; state exists in model).

Boot: 
```js
function boot(root){ ...build...; renderAll(); }
window.APP = {boot, _internals:{...}} for harness.
if(!window.__HARNESS__) boot on DOMContentLoaded — actually scripts at end of body, DOM ready; just boot immediately unless harness defers. harness includes scripts then calls APP.boot(el) manually; index.html auto-boots. Guard: if (document.getElementById('app')) boot(document.getElementById('app')); index has #app; harness uses its own container id and calls APP.boot. In harness, don't auto-boot: check `window.__HARNESS__` set by harness script BEFORE app.js loads → then app.js skips auto-boot. Order: data.js, set flag, app.js, harness script.
```

Internals exposure for harness: APP._t = {get state(){return state}, get trail(){return trail}, get tIndex(){return tIndex}, setAxis, toggleCatValue, setRange, timeTravel, undo, redo, matching, aggregate, commit, drill}.

XSS not a concern (static data). 

CSS: dark observatory theme, compact. Key colors (applying dataviz practice — sequential single-hue for heat, categorical muted for class badges):
--bg0:#0b0f14; --bg1:#11161d; --bg2:#171e27; --line:#2a3441; --tx:#dbe4ee; --tx2:#8fa1b3; --accent:#4cc2ff; --focus:#ffd166;
Heat ramp: 7 steps from #14212f → #d7f7ef? Single-hue teal: interpolate #0f2530 → #59d9c5; text dark when light bg.
Class badges: muted categorical: 岩石 #c98a5b, 超级地球 #7fb069, 海王星 #6aa7d8, 巨行星 #b58fd8 — desaturated.

Font: system stack "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; numerals: Consolas tabular for values (font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums).

Sizes: compact 12-13px base, dense paddings. Rail 236px, right col 320px, canvas flexible. Canvas table: full width, sticky headers (position:sticky within scroll container).

Total CSS ~300 lines. app.js ~600 lines. Write now.

One nuance — “维度切换不重置认知” ALSO should hold when drill-filtering changes data: measure choice + color scale normalization recalc is fine.

Record sort: by esi desc then name? Use stable: esi desc. Show top 60.

Inspector 落点: for quant axis: bin label containing record value; cat: value. Plus "格内 n 条" maybe. Keep simple.

Let me now write js/app.js. Careful with quoting in template strings — PowerShell Write tool is fine (writing raw file).

One more consideration: initial x='method', y='temp'. method 7 cols × temp 8 rows. Canvas table with margins — good.

Writing app.js now. I'll keep functions compact but readable. Also all UI text Chinese. Numbers formatted with fmt() per dim dec.

Edge case: drill when measure=avg — fine.

Time check: ~35 min elapsed. Remaining: write 3 files (~15 min), test harness + run (~10 min), screenshots (~5 min), README (~5 min), Prax validate (~5 min). OK.

input.content:
/* 星巡台 ASTRA · cell-j13-s10 —— 暗色观测台主题，紧凑密度，系统字体栈，零外部依赖 */

:root {
  --bg0: #0b0f14;
  --bg1: #10161e;
  --bg2: #161e28;
  --bg3: #1c2632;
  --line: #29323e;
  --line2: #3a4656;
  --tx: #d9e2ec;
  --tx2: #8b9bab;
  --tx3: #5d6b7a;
  --accent: #4cc2ff;
  --accent-dim: #1d4a63;
  --focus: #ffd166;
  --danger: #ff7b72;
  --ok: #56d364;
  --heat-lo: #12222e;
  --heat-hi: #59d9c5;
  --radius: 6px;
  --mono: Consolas, "Cascadia Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html, body { height: 100%; }
body {
  background: var(--bg0);
  color: var(--tx);
  font: 13px/1.45 "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", system-ui, sans-serif;
  overflow: hidden;
}
button { font: inherit; color: inherit; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
button:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, input:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 1px;
}

#app {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 246px minmax(0, 1fr) 332px;
  grid-template-rows: 46px minmax(0, 1fr);
  grid-template-areas: "top top top" "rail canvas right";
  height: 100vh;
}

/* ============ 顶栏 + 认知锁点条 ============ */
.topbar {
  grid-area: top;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
  padding: 0 14px;
  background: var(--bg1);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  z-index: 5;
}
.brand { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap; }
.brand-mark { color: var(--accent); font-size: 15px; }
.brand-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: .5px; }
.brand-name i { font-style: normal; color: var(--accent); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; }
.brand-sub { color: var(--tx3); font-size: 11px; }

.anchor-bar {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  min-width: 0; overflow-x: auto; flex: 1;
  scrollbar-width: none;
}
.chip {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
  padding: 3px 9px;
  background: var(--bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  cursor: default;
}
.chip b { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
.chip .k { color: var(--tx3); }
.chip.filter-chip { cursor: pointer; border-color: var(--accent-dim); background: rgba(76,194,255,.07); }
.chip.filter-chip:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
.chip.filter-chip .x { color: var(--tx2); padding: 0 1px; }
.chip.filter-chip .x:hover { color: var(--danger); }
.chip.focus-chip { border-color: #6b5a2a; background: rgba(255,209,102,.07); }
.chip.focus-chip b { color: var(--focus); }
.chip.dim-keep { cursor: default; }
.chip.dim-keep::before { content: "⟲"; color: var(--ok); font-size: 11px; }

/* ============ toast ============ */
.toast {
  position: fixed; top: 56px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  background: #12262e; color: #b8ecdf;
  border: 1px solid #2a5548; border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 7px 16px; font-size: 12.5px;
  z-index: 50; pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0; transition: opacity .25s;
}
.toast.show { opacity: 1; }

/* ============ 维度轨 ============ */
.dim-rail {
  grid-area: rail;
  overflow-y: auto;
  background: var(--bg1);
  border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 8px;
}
.rail-title {
  font-size: 11px; color: var(--tx3); letter-spacing: 1px;
  margin: 8px 4px 4px; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.dim {
  background: var(--bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.dim.on-x { border-color: var(--accent); box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent); }
.dim.on-y { border-color: #b58fd8; box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 #b58fd8; }
.dim.on-x.on-y { box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent), inset -3px 0 0 #b58fd8; }
.dim-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; padding: 6px 7px; }
.ax {
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700;
  width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 4px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line2); color: var(--tx2);
  flex: none;
}
.ax:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
.ax.x-active { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #06222f; }
.ax.y-active { background: #b58fd8; border-color: #b58fd8; color: #241233; }
.dim-name { flex: 1; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.badge {
  font-size: 9.5px; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; flex: none;
  background: var(--bg3); color: var(--tx2); border: 1px solid var(--line2);
}
.badge.cat { color: #86c7a4; }
.badge.quant { color: #d8a26a; }
.funnel { font-size: 12px; color: var(--tx3); width: 22px; height: 20px; border-radius: 4px; flex: none; }
.funnel:hover { color: var(--accent); background: var(--bg3); }
.funnel.has-f { color: var(--accent); }
.spark { display: block; width: 100%; height: 26px; padding: 0 7px 4px; }
.spark rect { fill: #37587a; }
.dim.filtered .dim-name::after { content: " ⏷"; color: var(--accent); font-size: 10px; }

.dim-edit {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 7px 8px 8px;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,.18);
}
.dim-edit .vals { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; max-height: 168px; overflow-y: auto; }
.dim-edit label.val {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--tx2);
}
.dim-edit label.val:hover { color: var(--tx); }
.dim-edit label.val input { accent-color: var(--accent); }
.dim-edit label.val .cnt { margin-left: auto; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--tx3); }
.dim-edit .range-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.dim-edit input[type=number] {
  width: 84px; background: var(--bg0); color: var(--tx);
  border: 1px solid var(--line2); border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 3px 6px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px;
}
.mini-actions { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 7px; }
.btn {
  padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11.5px;
  background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--line2); color: var(--tx);
}
.btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
.btn.primary { background: var(--accent-dim); border-color: var(--accent); color: #cdeeff; }
.btn.primary:hover { background: #256a8c; }
.btn.ghost { background: transparent; }
.btn:disabled { opacity: .35; cursor: default; }
.btn:disabled:hover { border-color: var(--line2); color: var(--tx); }

/* ============ 投影画布 ============ */
.canvas {
  grid-area: canvas;
  overflow: auto;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 70% -10%, rgba(76,194,255,.05), transparent 60%),
    var(--bg0);
}
.canvas-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.canvas-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
.canvas-title .arr { color: var(--tx3); font-family: var(--mono); padding: 0 3px; }
.canvas-title .xd { color: var(--accent); }
.canvas-title .yd { color: #c9a7ea; }
.canvas-note { color: var(--tx3); font-size: 11px; }
.measure-wrap { margin-left: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--tx2); }
.measure-wrap select {
  background: var(--bg2); color: var(--tx);
  border: 1px solid var(--line2); border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 3px 6px; font-size: 11.5px;
}
.legend { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line2); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }
.legend i { width: 22px; height: 10px; display: block; }

.heat { border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 2px; width: auto; }
.heat th, .heat td {
  font-weight: 400; font-size: 11px;
  border-radius: 3px;
}
.heat thead th {
  color: var(--tx2); background: var(--bg2);
  padding: 4px 7px; text-align: center;
  position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 2;
  max-width: 108px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.heat thead th.x-active-col { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent-dim); }
.heat tbody th {
  color: var(--tx2); background: var(--bg2);
  padding: 4px 7px; text-align: right;
  position: sticky; left: 0; z-index: 1;
  max-width: 130px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.heat tbody th.y-active-row { color: #c9a7ea; border-color: #4d3a63; }
.heat td.cell {
  width: 62px; height: 34px;
  text-align: center; cursor: pointer;
  font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);
}
.heat td.cell:hover { outline: 1.5px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: -1.5px; }
.heat td.cell .big { font-size: 12.5px; display: block; line-height: 1.15; }
.heat td.cell .sub { font-size: 9.5px; opacity: .72; display: block; line-height: 1.1; }
.heat td.cell.hot-tx { color: #06231c; }
.heat td.cell.hot-tx .sub { color: #07352b; }
.heat td.cell { color: #cfe6f3; }
.heat td.cell.zero { background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #131a22 0 4px, #10161d 4px 8px); color: var(--tx3); cursor: default; }
.heat td.cell.focus-cell { outline: 2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: -2px; }
.heat td.margin { background: var(--bg3); font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--tx2); text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
.heat th.corner { background: transparent; border-color: transparent; }
.empty-state {
  margin: 60px auto; text-align: center; color: var(--tx2); max-width: 420px;
}
.empty-state .glyph { font-size: 34px; color: var(--tx3); display: block; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.empty-state p { margin: 8px 0 14px; }

/* ============ 右列 ============ */
.rightcol {
  grid-area: right;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
  padding: 8px;
  background: var(--bg1);
  border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.panel {
  background: var(--bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  overflow: hidden;
  flex: none;
}
.panel.grow { flex: 1 1 0; min-height: 140px; }
.panel-h {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--tx2);
}
.panel-h .cnt { margin-left: auto; font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 400; font-size: 11px; color: var(--tx3); }
.panel-b { overflow-y: auto; flex: 1; }

/* 检查器 */
.insp-empty { padding: 12px 12px 14px; color: var(--tx3); font-size: 12px; }
.insp-body { padding: 8px 10px 10px; }
.insp-name { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--focus); }
.insp-sub { color: var(--tx3); font-size: 11px; margin: 1px 0 7px; }
.insp-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3px 12px; }
.insp-kv { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; padding: 2px 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line); }
.insp-kv .k { color: var(--tx3); }
.insp-kv .v { font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.insp-pos {
  margin-top: 8px; padding: 6px 8px;
  background: rgba(255,209,102,.06); border: 1px solid #4d4326; border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 11.5px; color: #e8d9a8;
}
.insp-pos b { color: var(--focus); }

/* 记录列表 */
.rec-row {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 64px 64px 44px;
  gap: 6px; align-items: baseline;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  cursor: pointer;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(41,50,62,.5);
}
.rec-row:hover { background: var(--bg3); }
.rec-row.current { background: rgba(255,209,102,.08); box-shadow: inset 2px 0 0 var(--focus); }
.rec-name { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; }
.rec-sub { color: var(--tx3); font-size: 10px; display: block; }
.rec-num { font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--tx2); text-align: right; }
.rec-head {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 64px 64px 44px; gap: 6px;
  padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--tx3);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  position: sticky; top: 0; background: var(--bg2); z-index: 1;
}
.rec-head span:not(:first-child), .rec-num { text-align: right; }
.rec-foot { padding: 5px 10px; color: var(--tx3); font-size: 10.5px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

/* 状态轨迹 */
.trail .panel-h .btn { padding: 1px 7px; font-size: 12px; }
.trail-list { padding: 4px 6px 8px; }
.trail-item {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 26px 1fr auto;
  gap: 7px; align-items: baseline;
  padding: 4px 6px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 11.5px;
}
.trail-item:hover { background: var(--bg3); }
.trail-item.current { background: rgba(76,194,255,.08); box-shadow: inset 2px 0 0 var(--accent); }
.trail-item.past { opacity: .55; }
.trail-seq { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; color: var(--tx3); }
.trail-act { min-width: 0; }
.trail-act .a { display: block; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.trail-act .src { display: block; color: var(--tx3); font-size: 10px; }
.trail-time { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; color: var(--tx3); }
.trail-hint { padding: 6px 10px 4px; color: var(--tx3); font-size: 10.5px; }

::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 10px; height: 10px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #2c3743; border-radius: 5px; border: 2px solid var(--bg1); }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }

tool_use_result.content:
/* 星巡台 ASTRA · cell-j13-s10 —— 暗色观测台主题，紧凑密度，系统字体栈，零外部依赖 */

:root {
  --bg0: #0b0f14;
  --bg1: #10161e;
  --bg2: #161e28;
  --bg3: #1c2632;
  --line: #29323e;
  --line2: #3a4656;
  --tx: #d9e2ec;
  --tx2: #8b9bab;
  --tx3: #5d6b7a;
  --accent: #4cc2ff;
  --accent-dim: #1d4a63;
  --focus: #ffd166;
  --danger: #ff7b72;
  --ok: #56d364;
  --heat-lo: #12222e;
  --heat-hi: #59d9c5;
  --radius: 6px;
  --mono: Consolas, "Cascadia Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html, body { height: 100%; }
body {
  background: var(--bg0);
  color: var(--tx);
  font: 13px/1.45 "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", system-ui, sans-serif;
  overflow: hidden;
}
button { font: inherit; color: inherit; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
button:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, input:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 1px;
}

#app {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 246px minmax(0, 1fr) 332px;
  grid-template-rows: 46px minmax(0, 1fr);
  grid-template-areas: "top top top" "rail canvas right";
  height: 100vh;
}

/* ============ 顶栏 + 认知锁点条 ============ */
.topbar {
  grid-area: top;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
  padding: 0 14px;
  background: var(--bg1);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  z-index: 5;
}
.brand { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap; }
.brand-mark { color: var(--accent); font-size: 15px; }
.brand-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: .5px; }
.brand-name i { font-style: normal; color: var(--accent); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; }
.brand-sub { color: var(--tx3); font-size: 11px; }

.anchor-bar {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  min-width: 0; overflow-x: auto; flex: 1;
  scrollbar-width: none;
}
.chip {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
  padding: 3px 9px;
  background: var(--bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  cursor: default;
}
.chip b { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
.chip .k { color: var(--tx3); }
.chip.filter-chip { cursor: pointer; border-color: var(--accent-dim); background: rgba(76,194,255,.07); }
.chip.filter-chip:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
.chip.filter-chip .x { color: var(--tx2); padding: 0 1px; }
.chip.filter-chip .x:hover { color: var(--danger); }
.chip.focus-chip { border-color: #6b5a2a; background: rgba(255,209,102,.07); }
.chip.focus-chip b { color: var(--focus); }
.chip.dim-keep { cursor: default; }
.chip.dim-keep::before { content: "⟲"; color: var(--ok); font-size: 11px; }

/* ============ toast ============ */
.toast {
  position: fixed; top: 56px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  background: #12262e; color: #b8ecdf;
  border: 1px solid #2a5548; border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 7px 16px; font-size: 12.5px;
  z-index: 50; pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0; transition: opacity .25s;
}
.toast.show { opacity: 1; }

/* ============ 维度轨 ============ */
.dim-rail {
  grid-area: rail;
  overflow-y: auto;
  background: var(--bg1);
  border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 8px;
}
.rail-title {
  font-size: 11px; color: var(--tx3); letter-spacing: 1px;
  margin: 8px 4px 4px; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.dim {
  background: var(--bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.dim.on-x { border-color: var(--accent); box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent); }
.dim.on-y { border-color: #b58fd8; box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 #b58fd8; }
.dim.on-x.on-y { box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent), inset -3px 0 0 #b58fd8; }
.dim-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; padding: 6px 7px; }
.ax {
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700;
  width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 4px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line2); color: var(--tx2);
  flex: none;
}
.ax:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
.ax.x-active { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #06222f; }
.ax.y-active { background: #b58fd8; border-color: #b58fd8; color: #241233; }
.dim-name { flex: 1; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.badge {
  font-size: 9.5px; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; flex: none;
  background: var(--bg3); color: var(--tx2); border: 1px solid var(--line2);
}
.badge.cat { color: #86c7a4; }
.badge.quant { color: #d8a26a; }
.funnel { font-size: 12px; color: var(--tx3); width: 22px; height: 20px; border-radius: 4px; flex: none; }
.funnel:hover { color: var(--accent); background: var(--bg3); }
.funnel.has-f { color: var(--accent); }
.spark { display: block; width: 100%; height: 26px; padding: 0 7px 4px; }
.spark rect { fill: #37587a; }
.dim.filtered .dim-name::after { content: " ⏷"; color: var(--accent); font-size: 10px; }

.dim-edit {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 7px 8px 8px;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,.18);
}
.dim-edit .vals { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; max-height: 168px; overflow-y: auto; }
.dim-edit label.val {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--tx2);
}
.dim-edit label.val:hover { color: var(--tx); }
.dim-edit label.val input { accent-color: var(--accent); }
.dim-edit label.val .cnt { margin-left: auto; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--tx3); }
.dim-edit .range-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.dim-edit input[type=number] {
  width: 84px; background: var(--bg0); color: var(--tx);
  border: 1px solid var(--line2); border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 3px 6px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px;
}
.mini-actions { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 7px; }
.btn {
  padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11.5px;
  background: var(--bg3); border: 1px solid var(--line2); color: var(--tx);
}
.btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
.btn.primary { background: var(--accent-dim); border-color: var(--accent); color: #cdeeff; }
.btn.primary:hover { background: #256a8c; }
.btn.ghost { background: transparent; }
.btn:disabled { opacity: .35; cursor: default; }
.btn:disabled:hover { border-color: var(--line2); color: var(--tx); }

/* ============ 投影画布 ============ */
.canvas {
  grid-area: canvas;
  overflow: auto;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 70% -10%, rgba(76,194,255,.05), transparent 60%),
    var(--bg0);
}
.canvas-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.canvas-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
.canvas-title .arr { color: var(--tx3); font-family: var(--mono); padding: 0 3px; }
.canvas-title .xd { color: var(--accent); }
.canvas-title .yd { color: #c9a7ea; }
.canvas-note { color: var(--tx3); font-size: 11px; }
.measure-wrap { margin-left: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--tx2); }
.measure-wrap select {
  background: var(--bg2); color: var(--tx);
  border: 1px solid var(--line2); border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 3px 6px; font-size: 11.5px;
}
.legend { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line2); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }
.legend i { width: 22px; height: 10px; display: block; }

.heat { border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 2px; width: auto; }
.heat th, .heat td {
  font-weight: 400; font-size: 11px;
  border-radius: 3px;
}
.heat thead th {
  color: var(--tx2); background: var(--bg2);
  padding: 4px 7px; text-align: center;
  position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 2;
  max-width: 108px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.heat thead th.x-active-col { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent-dim); }
.heat tbody th {
  color: var(--tx2); background: var(--bg2);
  padding: 4px 7px; text-align: right;
  position: sticky; left: 0; z-index: 1;
  max-width: 130px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.heat tbody th.y-active-row { color: #c9a7ea; border-color: #4d3a63; }
.heat td.cell {
  width: 62px; height: 34px;
  text-align: center; cursor: pointer;
  font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);
}
.heat td.cell:hover { outline: 1.5px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: -1.5px; }
.heat td.cell .big { font-size: 12.5px; display: block; line-height: 1.15; }
.heat td.cell .sub { font-size: 9.5px; opacity: .72; display: block; line-height: 1.1; }
.heat td.cell.hot-tx { color: #06231c; }
.heat td.cell.hot-tx .sub { color: #07352b; }
.heat td.cell { color: #cfe6f3; }
.heat td.cell.zero { background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #131a22 0 4px, #10161d 4px 8px); color: var(--tx3); cursor: default; }
.heat td.cell.focus-cell { outline: 2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset: -2px; }
.heat td.margin { background: var(--bg3); font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--tx2); text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
.heat th.corner { background: transparent; border-color: transparent; }
.empty-state {
  margin: 60px auto; text-align: center; color: var(--tx2); max-width: 420px;
}
.empty-state .glyph { font-size: 34px; color: var(--tx3); display: block; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.empty-state p { margin: 8px 0 14px; }

/* ============ 右列 ============ */
.rightcol {
  grid-area: right;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
  padding: 8px;
  background: var(--bg1);
  border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.panel {
  background: var(--bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  overflow: hidden;
  flex: none;
}
.panel.grow { flex: 1 1 0; min-height: 140px; }
.panel-h {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--tx2);
}
.panel-h .cnt { margin-left: auto; font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 400; font-size: 11px; color: var(--tx3); }
.panel-b { overflow-y: auto; flex: 1; }

/* 检查器 */
.insp-empty { padding: 12px 12px 14px; color: var(--tx3); font-size: 12px; }
.insp-body { padding: 8px 10px 10px; }
.insp-name { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--focus); }
.insp-sub { color: var(--tx3); font-size: 11px; margin: 1px 0 7px; }
.insp-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3px 12px; }
.insp-kv { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; padding: 2px 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line); }
.insp-kv .k { color: var(--tx3); }
.insp-kv .v { font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.insp-pos {
  margin-top: 8px; padding: 6px 8px;
  background: rgba(255,209,102,.06); border: 1px solid #4d4326; border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 11.5px; color: #e8d9a8;
}
.insp-pos b { color: var(--focus); }

/* 记录列表 */
.rec-row {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 64px 64px 44px;
  gap: 6px; align-items: baseline;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  cursor: pointer;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(41,50,62,.5);
}
.rec-row:hover { background: var(--bg3); }
.rec-row.current { background: rgba(255,209,102,.08); box-shadow: inset 2px 0 0 var(--focus); }
.rec-name { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; }
.rec-sub { color: var(--tx3); font-size: 10px; display: block; }
.rec-num { font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--tx2); text-align: right; }
.rec-head {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 64px 64px 44px; gap: 6px;
  padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--tx3);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  position: sticky; top: 0; background: var(--bg2); z-index: 1;
}
.rec-head span:not(:first-child), .rec-num { text-align: right; }
.rec-foot { padding: 5px 10px; color: var(--tx3); font-size: 10.5px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

/* 状态轨迹 */
.trail .panel-h .btn { padding: 1px 7px; font-size: 12px; }
.trail-list { padding: 4px 6px 8px; }
.trail-item {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 26px 1fr auto;
  gap: 7px; align-items: baseline;
  padding: 4px 6px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 11.5px;
}
.trail-item:hover { background: var(--bg3); }
.trail-item.current { background: rgba(76,194,255,.08); box-shadow: inset 2px 0 0 var(--accent); }
.trail-item.past { opacity: .55; }
.trail-seq { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; color: var(--tx3); }
.trail-act { min-width: 0; }
.trail-act .a { display: block; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.trail-act .src { display: block; color: var(--tx3); font-size: 10px; }
.trail-time { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; color: var(--tx3); }
.trail-hint { padding: 6px 10px 4px; color: var(--tx3); font-size: 10.5px; }

::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 10px; height: 10px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #2c3743; border-radius: 5px; border: 2px solid var(--bg1); }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }

input.content:
/* 星巡台 ASTRA · cell-j13-s10 —— 多维数据探索（explore × dimensional-space）
 *
 * 设计契约（Prax 会话 ds_20261023205741_2a9a445c）：
 *  1. 维度切换不重置认知：换轴仅触碰 viewport（投影轴），query(过滤)/selection(聚焦)/
 *     度量/轨迹一律保留 —— projection_model 与 filter_model、focus_model 相互独立。
 *  2. 过滤/投影状态有归属且可回退：每次变更压入完整状态快照（归属 = 触发操作名 +
 *     来源 + 时间戳），轨迹条目即快照引用，点击回退；另配撤销/重做。
 *  3. 首屏即用：数据由 js/data.js 内联，同步初始化，无加载态、无网络请求。
 */
(function () {
  'use strict';

  var S = window.SURVEY;
  var DIM = {};
  S.dims.forEach(function (d) { DIM[d.id] = d; });
  var QUANT = S.dims.filter(function (d) { return d.type === 'quant'; });

  /* ---------------- 工具 ---------------- */
  function clone(o) { return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(o)); }
  function esc(s) {
    return String(s).replace(/[&<>"]/g, function (c) {
      return { '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;' }[c];
    });
  }
  function fmtV(dim, v) {
    var d = DIM[dim];
    if (d.type === 'cat') return String(v);
    var dec = (v >= 1000) ? 0 : d.dec;
    return Number(v).toFixed(dec);
  }
  function ts(d) {
    function p(n) { return (n < 10 ? '0' : '') + n; }
    return p(d.getHours()) + ':' + p(d.getMinutes()) + ':' + p(d.getSeconds());
  }
  function hsl2hex(h, s, l) {
    l /= 100; var a = s * Math.min(l, 1 - l) / 100;
    function f(n) {
      var k = (n + h / 30) % 12;
      var c = l - a * Math.max(Math.min(k - 3, 9 - k, 1), -1);
      return Math.round(255 * c).toString(16).padStart(2, '0');
    }
    return '#' + f(0) + f(8) + f(4);
  }
  /* 热力色标：单色相顺序色（暗底 → 亮青），7 级量化，保证顺序可读（dataviz 惯例） */
  var HEAT = [];
  (function () {
    for (var i = 0; i < 7; i++) {
      var t = i / 6;
      // 从深蓝黑 (#12222e) 插值到亮青 (#59d9c5)
      var c0 = [0x12, 0x22, 0x2e], c1 = [0x59, 0xd9, 0xc5];
      var c = c0.map(function (v, k) { return Math.round(v + (c1[k] - v) * t); });
      HEAT.push({ bg: 'rgb(' + c.join(',') + ')', light: t > 0.55 });
    }
  })();

  /* ---------------- 状态模型 ---------------- */
  var BASE = {
    x: 'method',            // 投影 X 轴（viewport）
    y: 'temp',              // 投影 Y 轴（viewport）
    measure: { kind: 'count', dim: null }, // 度量（投影状态）
    filters: [],            // query：[{dim, kind:'cat', values:[]}|{dim, kind:'range', lo, hi}]
    focus: null             // selection：记录 id
  };
  var state;      // 当前已提交状态
  var trail = []; // [{seq, time, action, source, snap}] —— 快照栈：归属 + 回退
  var tIndex = 0; // 当前所处轨迹位置
  var ui = { openDim: null }; // 纯 UI 态（不进入快照）

  function snapshot() {
    return { x: state.x, y: state.y, measure: clone(state.measure), filters: clone(state.filters), focus: state.focus };
  }

  /* 每次过滤/投影变更统一走 commit：压入快照，归属 = action + source + time */
  function commit(action, source, mutate) {
    trail = trail.slice(0, tIndex + 1); // 丢弃重做分支
    mutate();
    trail.push({ seq: trail.length, time: new Date(), action: action, source: source, snap: snapshot() });
    tIndex = trail.length - 1;
    renderAll();
  }
  function timeTravel(i) {
    if (i < 0 || i >= trail.length || i === tIndex) return;
    tIndex = i;
    state = clone(trail[i].snap);
    renderAll();
  }
  function undo() { timeTravel(tIndex - 1); }
  function redo() { timeTravel(tIndex + 1); }

  function filterOf(dim) {
    for (var i = 0; i < state.filters.length; i++) if (state.filters[i].dim === dim) return state.filters[i];
    return null;
  }
  function matching() {
    return S.records.filter(function (r) {
      for (var i = 0; i < state.filters.length; i++) {
        var f = state.filters[i], v = r[f.dim];
        if (f.kind === 'cat') { if (f.values.indexOf(v) < 0) return false; }
        else { if (v < f.lo || v > f.hi) return false; }
      }
      return true;
    });
  }

  /* 数量维度：固定分箱（全域 8 箱）—— 过滤/换轴后参照系不变，认知不漂移 */
  var DOMAIN = {};
  QUANT.forEach(function (d) {
    var lo = Infinity, hi = -Infinity;
    S.records.forEach(function (r) { lo = Math.min(lo, r[d.id]); hi = Math.max(hi, r[d.id]); });
    DOMAIN[d.id] = { lo: lo, hi: hi, n: 8 };
  });
  function binOf(dim, v) {
    var d = DOMAIN[dim];
    return Math.min(d.n - 1, Math.max(0, Math.floor((v - d.lo) / (d.hi - d.lo) * d.n)));
  }
  function binLabel(dim, i) {
    var d = DOMAIN[dim], w = (d.hi - d.lo) / d.n;
    var a = d.lo + i * w, b = a + w;
    return fmtV(dim, a) + '–' + fmtV(dim, b);
  }
  function axisVals(dim) {
    if (DIM[dim].type === 'cat') return DIM[dim].values.slice();
    var out = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < DOMAIN[dim].n; i++) out.push({ bin: i });
    return out;
  }
  function axisIndexOf(dim, v) {
    return DIM[dim].type === 'cat' ? DIM[dim].values.indexOf(v) : binOf(dim, v);
  }

  /* ---------------- 交互动作 ---------------- */
  /* 换轴：只动 viewport —— 过滤、聚焦、度量、轨迹原样保留（成功标准的实现点） */
  function setAxis(axis, dim, source) {
    var target = axis === 'x' ? 'x' : 'y', other = axis === 'x' ? 'y' : 'x';
    var swapped = false;
    commit('换轴 ' + target.toUpperCase() + ' → ' + DIM[dim].label, source || '维度轨 · 点击', function () {
      if (state[other] === dim) { state[other] = state[target]; swapped = true; }
      state[target] = dim;
    });
    toast(swapped ? '已对调两轴 · 过滤 ' + state.filters.length + ' 项、聚焦与轨迹全部保留'
                  : '维度已切换 · 过滤 ' + state.filters.length + ' 项、聚焦与轨迹全部保留');
  }
  function setMeasure(kind, dim) {
    var label = kind === 'count' ? '计数' : '平均 · ' + DIM[dim].label;
    commit('度量 → ' + label, '投影画布 · 度量选择', function () {
      state.measure = kind === 'count' ? { kind: 'count', dim: null } : { kind: 'avg', dim: dim };
    });
  }
  function drillCell(yVal, xVal) {
    var targets = [];
    [[state.x, xVal], [state.y, yVal]].forEach(function (p) {
      var dim = p[0], v = p[1], cur = filterOf(dim);
      if (DIM[dim].type === 'cat') {
        var same = cur && cur.values.length === 1 && cur.values[0] === v;
        if (!same) targets.push({ dim: dim, kind: 'cat', values: [v] });
      } else {
        var d = DOMAIN[dim], w = (d.hi - d.lo) / d.n, i = v.bin;
        var lo = d.lo + i * w, hi = d.lo + (i + 1) * w;
        var same2 = cur && cur.kind === 'range' && cur.lo === lo && cur.hi === hi;
        if (!same2) targets.push({ dim: dim, kind: 'range', lo: lo, hi: hi });
      }
    });
    if (!targets.length) { toast('该单元格已被当前过滤覆盖'); return; }
    var desc = targets.map(function (t) { return DIM[t.dim].label + '=' + (t.kind === 'cat' ? t.values[0] : binLabel(t.dim, Math.floor((t.lo - DOMAIN[t.dim].lo) / ((DOMAIN[t.dim].hi - DOMAIN[t.dim].lo) / DOMAIN[t.dim].n)))); }).join(' 且 ');
    commit('下钻 [' + desc + ']', '投影画布 · 单元格点击', function () {
      targets.forEach(function (t) {
        var k = state.filters.findIndex(function (f) { return f.dim === t.dim; });
        if (k >= 0) state.filters[k] = t; else state.filters.push(t);
      });
    });
  }
  function toggleCatValue(dim, val, source) {
    var f = filterOf(dim);
    var had = !!(f && f.values.indexOf(val) >= 0);
    commit((had ? '解除过滤 ' : '过滤 ') + DIM[dim].label + '=' + val, source, function () {
      var cur = filterOf(dim);
      if (!cur) { state.filters.push({ dim: dim, kind: 'cat', values: [val] }); return; }
      var vals = cur.values.slice(), k = vals.indexOf(val);
      if (k >= 0) {
        vals.splice(k, 1);
        if (!vals.length) state.filters = state.filters.filter(function (x) { return x.dim !== dim; });
        else cur.values = vals;
      } else { vals.push(val); cur.values = vals; }
    });
  }
  function setRange(dim, lo, hi, source) {
    commit('过滤 ' + DIM[dim].label + ' ∈ [' + fmtV(dim, lo) + ', ' + fmtV(dim, hi) + ']', source, function () {
      var f = filterOf(dim);
      if (f) { f.kind = 'range'; f.lo = lo; f.hi = hi; delete f.values; }
      else state.filters.push({ dim: dim, kind: 'range', lo: lo, hi: hi });
    });
  }
  function clearFilter(dim, source) {
    commit('解除 ' + DIM[dim].label + ' 过滤', source, function () {
      state.filters = state.filters.filter(function (f) { return f.dim !== dim; });
    });
  }
  function clearAllFilters() {
    commit('清除全部过滤（' + state.filters.length + ' 项）', '投影画布 · 空状态恢复', function () {
      state.filters = [];
    });
  }
  function setFocus(id, source) {
    var r = recById(id);
    if (state.focus === id) return;
    var wasNull = !state.focus;
    commit((wasNull ? '聚焦 ' : '切换聚焦 ') + r.name, source, function () { state.focus = id; });
  }
  function clearFocus() {
    commit('清除聚焦', '检查器 · 操作', function () { state.focus = null; });
  }
  function recById(id) {
    for (var i = 0; i < S.records.length; i++) if (S.records[i].id === id) return S.records[i];
    return null;
  }

  /* ---------------- toast ---------------- */
  var toastTimer = null;
  function toast(msg) {
    var t = document.getElementById('toast');
    t.textContent = msg;
    t.hidden = false;
    requestAnimationFrame(function () { t.classList.add('show'); });
    clearTimeout(toastTimer);
    toastTimer = setTimeout(function () {
      t.classList.remove('show');
      toastTimer = setTimeout(function () { t.hidden = true; }, 300);
    }, 2000);
  }

  /* ---------------- 渲染 ---------------- */
  function renderAll() {
    renderAnchor();
    renderRail();
    renderCanvas();
    renderRecords();
    renderTrail();
    renderInspector();
  }

  /* 认知锁点条：跨维度切换恒定的锚点（H-21 定向不变量的可见化） */
  function renderAnchor() {
    var nF = state.filters.length;
    var fRec = state.focus ? recById(state.focus) : null;
    var mLabel = state.measure.kind === 'count' ? '计数' : '平均 · ' + DIM[state.measure.dim].label;
    var html = '';
    html += '<span class="chip dim-keep" title="投影轴：跨维度切换由你主动更换，此处恒定显示当前轴">投影 <b>' + esc(DIM[state.y].label) + '</b><span class="k">×</span><b>' + esc(DIM[state.x].label) + '</b></span>';
    html += '<span class="chip dim-keep" title="度量选择不随换轴重置">度量 <b>' + esc(mLabel) + '</b></span>';
    html += '<span class="chip" title="当前过滤下的记录数（总数恒定）"><span class="k">匹配</span><b>' + matching().length + '</b><span class="k">/ ' + S.records.length + '</span></span>';
    if (fRec) html += '<span class="chip focus-chip" title="聚焦记录跨维度切换保持锚定">聚焦 <b>' + esc(fRec.name) + '</b></span>';
    else html += '<span class="chip" title="尚未聚焦记录；聚焦后同样跨维度切换保持"><span class="k">聚焦</span>无</span>';
    html += '<span class="chip" title="状态轨迹深度：归属与回退见状态轨迹面板"><span class="k">轨迹</span><b>' + (tIndex + 1) + '</b><span class="k">/ ' + trail.length + '</span></span>';
    state.filters.forEach(function (f) {
      var owner = ownerOf(f.dim);
      var label = DIM[f.dim].label + ' = ' + (f.kind === 'cat' ? f.values.join('∣') : '[' + fmtV(f.dim, f.lo) + ', ' + fmtV(f.dim, f.hi) + ']');
      html += '<span class="chip filter-chip" data-clear-dim="' + f.dim + '" title="归属：' + esc(owner.action) + ' · ' + esc(owner.time) + '（点击移除，可经轨迹回退恢复）">' + esc(label) + '<span class="x" aria-label="移除过滤">×</span></span>';
    });
    document.getElementById('anchorBar').innerHTML = html;
  }
  /* 归属查询：找到引入/最后更新该维度过滤的轨迹条目 */
  function ownerOf(dim) {
    for (var i = trail.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
      var a = trail[i].action;
      if (a.indexOf(DIM[dim].label) >= 0 && (a.indexOf('过滤') === 0 || a.indexOf('下钻') === 0 || a.indexOf('解除') === 0 || a.indexOf('清除') === 0))
        return { action: a, time: ts(trail[i].time) };
    }
    return { action: '初始状态', time: ts(trail[0].time) };
  }

  function renderRail() {
    var fams = {};
    S.dims.forEach(function (d) { (fams[d.family] = fams[d.family] || []).push(d); });
    var html = '';
    Object.keys(fams).forEach(function (fam) {
      html += '<div class="rail-title">' + esc(fam) + '</div>';
      fams[fam].forEach(function (d) {
        var onX = state.x === d.id, onY = state.y === d.id;
        var f = filterOf(d.id);
        html += '<div class="dim' + (onX ? ' on-x' : '') + (onY ? ' on-y' : '') + (f ? ' filtered' : '') + '">';
        html += '<div class="dim-head">';
        html += '<button class="ax' + (onX ? ' x-active' : '') + '" data-axis="x" data-dim="' + d.id + '" title="设为 X 轴（列）' + (onY ? '；当前为 Y 轴，点击将对调' : '') + '">X</button>';
        html += '<button class="ax' + (onY ? ' y-active' : '') + '" data-axis="y" data-dim="' + d.id + '" title="设为 Y 轴（行）' + (onX ? '；当前为 X 轴，点击将对调' : '') + '">Y</button>';
        html += '<span class="dim-name">' + esc(d.label) + (d.unit ? ' <i style="font-style:normal;color:var(--tx3)">(' + d.unit + ')</i>' : '') + '</span>';
        html += '<span class="badge ' + d.type + '">' + (d.type === 'cat' ? '类' : '量') + '</span>';
        html += '<button class="funnel' + (f ? ' has-f' : '') + '" data-funnel="' + d.id + '" title="过滤此维度">◮' + (f ? '<sub>' + (f.kind === 'cat' ? f.values.length : '∈') + '</sub>' : '') + '</button>';
        html += '</div>';
        html += sparkline(d.id);
        if (ui.openDim === d.id) html += filterEditor(d.id);
        html += '</div>';
      });
    });
    var rail = document.getElementById('dimRail');
    rail.innerHTML = html;
  }
  function sparkline(dim) {
    var d = DIM[dim], vals;
    if (d.type === 'cat') {
      vals = d.values.map(function (v) {
        return S.records.reduce(function (s, r) { return s + (r[dim] === v ? 1 : 0); }, 0);
      });
    } else {
      vals = new Array(DOMAIN[dim].n).fill(0);
      S.records.forEach(function (r) { vals[binOf(dim, r[dim])]++; });
    }
    var max = Math.max.apply(null, vals);
    var bars = vals.map(function (v) {
      var h = max ? Math.max(1.5, v / max * 22) : 1.5;
      return '<rect height="' + h.toFixed(1) + '" width="' + (100 / vals.length - 1.2) + '" x="' + (vals.indexOf(v) === -1 ? 0 : vals.indexOf(v)) + '" y="' + (24 - h).toFixed(1) + '"></rect>';
    });
    // 上面 indexOf 技巧在重复值时不可靠，改为索引循环
    bars = vals.map(function (v, i) {
      var h = max ? Math.max(1.5, v / max * 22) : 1.5;
      return '<rect height="' + h.toFixed(1) + '" width="' + (100 / vals.length - 1.2).toFixed(2) + '" x="' + (i * 100 / vals.length).toFixed(2) + '" y="' + (24 - h).toFixed(1) + '"></rect>';
    }).join('');
    return '<svg class="spark" viewBox="0 0 100 24" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">' + bars + '</svg>';
  }
  function filterEditor(dim) {
    var d = DIM[dim], f = filterOf(dim), html = '<div class="dim-edit">';
    if (d.type === 'cat') {
      html += '<div class="vals">';
      d.values.forEach(function (v) {
        var n = S.records.reduce(function (s, r) { return s + (r[dim] === v ? 1 : 0); }, 0);
        var on = f && f.values.indexOf(v) >= 0;
        html += '<label class="val"><input type="checkbox" data-catval="' + esc(v) + '" data-catdim="' + dim + '"' + (on ? ' checked' : '') + '> ' + esc(v) + '<span class="cnt">' + n + '</span></label>';
      });
      html += '</div>';
    } else {
      var lo = f ? f.lo : DOMAIN[dim].lo, hi = f ? f.hi : DOMAIN[dim].hi;
      html += '<div class="range-row"><input type="number" id="rng-' + dim + '-lo" value="' + lo + '" step="any" aria-label="最小值"> <span style="color:var(--tx3)">–</span> <input type="number" id="rng-' + dim + '-hi" value="' + hi + '" step="any" aria-label="最大值"></div>';
    }
    html += '<div class="mini-actions">';
    html += '<button class="btn primary" data-applyf="' + dim + '">应用过滤</button>';
    if (f) html += '<button class="btn ghost" data-clearf="' + dim + '">清除</button>';
    html += '</div></div>';
    return html;
  }

  function renderCanvas() {
    var el = document.getElementById('canvas');
    var xv = axisVals(state.x), yv = axisVals(state.y);
    var rows = matching();
    var mLabel = state.measure.kind === 'count' ? '计数' : '平均 · ' + DIM[state.measure.dim].label;

    var head = '<div class="canvas-head">';
    head += '<span class="canvas-title"><span class="yd">' + esc(DIM[state.y].label) + '</span><span class="arr">╲</span><span class="xd">' + esc(DIM[state.x].label) + '</span></span>';
    head += '<span class="canvas-note">单元格点击 = 下钻为过滤（归属并记入轨迹）· 换轴不改变过滤 / 聚焦 / 度量</span>';
    head += '<span class="measure-wrap">度量 <select id="measureSel" aria-label="度量选择">';
    head += '<option value="count"' + (state.measure.kind === 'count' ? ' selected' : '') + '>计数</option>';
    QUANT.forEach(function (d) {
      head += '<option value="avg:' + d.id + '"' + (state.measure.kind === 'avg' && state.measure.dim === d.id ? ' selected' : '') + '>平均 · ' + esc(d.label) + (d.unit ? '(' + d.unit + ')' : '') + '</option>';
    });
    head += '</select>';
    // 图例
    head += '<span class="legend" title="热力色标：低 → 高">';
    for (var li = 0; li < 7; li++) head += '<i style="background:' + HEAT[li].bg + '"></i>';
    head += '</span></span></div>';

    if (!rows.length) {
      el.innerHTML = head + '<div class="empty-state"><span class="glyph">◌</span>' +
        '<p>当前过滤组合下没有匹配记录（空集）。<br>过滤与投影状态仍被完整记录与保留。</p>' +
        '<button class="btn primary" id="clearAllBtn">清除全部过滤（' + state.filters.length + ' 项）</button></div>';
      return;
    }

    // 聚合
    var useAvg = state.measure.kind === 'avg', mDim = state.measure.dim;
    var cnt = [], agg = [], rowTot = [], colTot = new Array(xv.length).fill(0);
    var mVal = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < yv.length; i++) {
      cnt.push(new Array(xv.length).fill(0));
      mVal.push(new Array(xv.length).fill(0));
      rowTot.push(0);
    }
    var colAgg = new Array(xv.length).fill(0);
    rows.forEach(function (r) {
      var j = axisIndexOf(state.x, r[state.x]);
      var i2 = axisIndexOf(state.y, r[state.y]);
      cnt[i2][j]++; rowTot[i2]++; colTot[j]++;
      if (useAvg) { mVal[i2][j] += r[mDim]; colAgg[j] += r[mDim]; }
    });
    var cellDisp = cnt.map(function (row, i2) {
      return row.map(function (c, j) {
        if (!c) return null;
        return useAvg ? mVal[i2][j] / c : c;
      });
    });
    var maxCell = 0;
    cellDisp.forEach(function (row) { row.forEach(function (v) { if (v !== null) maxCell = Math.max(maxCell, v); }); });
    function heatLevel(v) { return Math.min(6, Math.floor(v / (maxCell || 1) * 6.999)); }

    var fRec = state.focus ? recById(state.focus) : null;
    var focusCell = null;
    if (fRec) focusCell = [axisIndexOf(state.y, fRec[state.y]), axisIndexOf(state.x, fRec[state.x])];

    var html = head + '<table class="heat"><thead><tr><th class="corner">' + esc(DIM[state.y].label) + ' ╲ ' + esc(DIM[state.x].label) + '</th>';
    xv.forEach(function (v, j) {
      var lab = DIM[state.x].type === 'cat' ? v : binLabel(state.x, v.bin);
      html += '<th' + (state.xIsQuantCol ? '' : '') + ' class="' + (state.x === state.measure.dim && useAvg ? 'x-active-col' : '') + '" title="' + esc(lab) + '">' + esc(lab) + '</th>';
    });
    html += '<th class="margin">Σ</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
    yv.forEach(function (v, i2) {
      var lab = DIM[state.y].type === 'cat' ? v : binLabel(state.y, v.bin);
      html += '<tr><th class="' + (state.y === state.measure.dim && useAvg ? 'y-active-row' : '') + '" title="' + esc(lab) + '">' + esc(lab) + '</th>';
      xv.forEach(function (_, j) {
        var c = cnt[i2][j];
        var cls = 'cell' + (!c ? ' zero' : '');
        var style = '';
        if (c) {
          var hl = heatLevel(cellDisp[i2][j]);
          style = 'background:' + HEAT[hl].bg;
          if (HEAT[hl].light) cls += ' hot-tx';
        }
        if (focusCell && focusCell[0] === i2 && focusCell[1] === j) cls += ' focus-cell';
        var big = c === 0 ? '·' : (useAvg ? fmtV(mDim, cellDisp[i2][j]) : c);
        var sub = c === 0 ? '' : (useAvg ? 'n=' + c : '');
        html += '<td class="' + cls + '" style="' + style + '" data-cell="' + i2 + ',' + j + '" title="' + esc(DIM[state.y].label) + '×' + esc(DIM[state.x].label) + ': n=' + c + (c && useAvg ? ', avg=' + fmtV(mDim, cellDisp[i2][j]) : '') + '（点击下钻）">' +
          '<span class="big">' + big + '</span>' + (sub ? '<span class="sub">' + sub + '</span>' : '') + '</td>';
      });
      html += '<td class="margin">' + rowTot[i2] + '</td></tr>';
    });
    html += '<tr><th class="margin" style="text-align:right">Σ</th>';
    xv.forEach(function (_, j) { html += '<td class="margin">' + colTot[j] + '</td>'; });
    html += '<td class="margin">' + rows.length + '</td></tr></tbody></table>';
    el.innerHTML = html;
  }

  function renderRecords() {
    var el = document.getElementById('records');
    var rows = matching();
    var html = '<div class="panel-h">匹配记录<span class="cnt">' + rows.length + ' / ' + S.records.length + '</span></div>';
    html += '<div class="rec-head"><span>名称 / 类别</span><span>温度 K</span><span>距离 ly</span><span>ESI</span></div>';
    html += '<div class="panel-b">';
    var LIMIT = 60;
    rows.slice(0, LIMIT).forEach(function (r) {
      var cur = state.focus === r.id;
      html += '<div class="rec-row' + (cur ? ' current' : '') + '" data-rec="' + r.id + '" title="点击聚焦（跨维度切换保持）">' +
        '<span class="rec-name">' + esc(r.name) + '<span class="rec-sub">' + esc(r.pclass) + ' · ' + esc(r.star) + '</span></span>' +
        '<span class="rec-num">' + r.temp + '</span><span class="rec-num">' + r.dist + '</span><span class="rec-num">' + r.esi.toFixed(2) + '</span></div>';
    });
    html += '</div>';
    if (rows.length > LIMIT) html += '<div class="rec-foot">仅显示前 ' + LIMIT + ' 条（按宜居指数序），共 ' + rows.length + ' 条匹配</div>';
    el.innerHTML = html;
  }

  function renderTrail() {
    var el = document.getElementById('trail');
    var html = '<div class="panel-h">状态轨迹 · 归属与回退' +
      '<span style="margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:4px">' +
      '<button class="btn" id="undoBtn" title="撤销（Ctrl+Z）"' + (tIndex > 0 ? '' : ' disabled') + '>↶</button>' +
      '<button class="btn" id="redoBtn" title="重做（Ctrl+Shift+Z）"' + (tIndex < trail.length - 1 ? '' : ' disabled') + '>↷</button>' +
      '<button class="btn" id="baseBtn" title="回到初始状态"' + (tIndex > 0 ? '' : ' disabled') + '>⤺</button>' +
      '</span></div>';
    html += '<div class="trail-hint">每条 = 一个完整状态快照（归属：触发操作 + 来源 + 时间）。点击任意条目回退到该时刻；之后的操作会开新分支。</div>';
    html += '<div class="trail-list">';
    for (var i = trail.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
      var t = trail[i];
      var cls = 'trail-item' + (i === tIndex ? ' current' : '') + (i < tIndex ? ' past' : '');
      html += '<div class="' + cls + '" data-tidx="' + i + '" title="点击回退到该状态">' +
        '<span class="trail-seq">#' + t.seq + '</span>' +
        '<span class="trail-act"><span class="a">' + esc(t.action) + '</span><span class="src">归属：' + esc(t.source) + '</span></span>' +
        '<span class="trail-time">' + ts(t.time) + '</span></div>';
    }
    html += '</div>';
    el.innerHTML = html;
  }

  function renderInspector() {
    var el = document.getElementById('inspector');
    var r = state.focus ? recById(state.focus) : null;
    if (!r) {
      el.innerHTML = '<div class="panel-h">聚焦检查器</div><div class="insp-empty">尚未聚焦记录。点击画布下方的记录列表，或在投影中下钻后选择一条行星；聚焦会<b style="color:var(--tx2)">跨维度切换保持</b>，其投影落点随当前轴自动更新。</div>';
      return;
    }
    var html = '<div class="panel-h">聚焦检查器<span class="cnt">' + esc(r.id) + '</span></div><div class="insp-body">';
    html += '<div class="insp-name">' + esc(r.name) + '</div>';
    html += '<div class="insp-sub">' + esc(r.pclass) + ' · ' + esc(r.method) + ' · ' + esc(r.star) + ' · ' + esc(r.sky) + '</div>';
    html += '<div class="insp-grid">';
    QUANT.forEach(function (d) {
      html += '<div class="insp-kv"><span class="k">' + esc(d.label) + (d.unit ? '(' + d.unit + ')' : '') + '</span><span class="v">' + fmtV(d.id, r[d.id]) + '</span></div>';
    });
    html += '</div>';
    var xLab = DIM[state.x].type === 'cat' ? r[state.x] : binLabel(state.x, binOf(state.x, r[state.x]));
    var yLab = DIM[state.y].type === 'cat' ? r[state.y] : binLabel(state.y, binOf(state.y, r[state.y]));
    html += '<div class="insp-pos">当前投影落点：<b>' + esc(DIM[state.y].label) + '</b>=' + esc(yLab) + ' × <b>' + esc(DIM[state.x].label) + '</b>=' + esc(xLab) + '<br><span style="color:var(--tx3)">换轴后此行随当前投影自动更新，聚焦本身不丢失。</span></div>';
    html += '<div class="mini-actions"><button class="btn" id="clearFocusBtn">清除聚焦</button></div></div>';
    el.innerHTML = html;
  }

  /* ---------------- 事件绑定 ---------------- */
  function bind() {
    document.getElementById('dimRail').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var ax = e.target.closest('.ax');
      if (ax) { setAxis(ax.dataset.axis, ax.dataset.dim, '维度轨 · ' + ax.dataset.axis.toUpperCase() + ' 轴按钮'); return; }
      var fn = e.target.closest('.funnel');
      if (fn) { ui.openDim = ui.openDim === fn.dataset.funnel ? null : fn.dataset.funnel; renderRail(); }
    });
    document.getElementById('dimRail').addEventListener('change', function (e) {
      // 分类复选框即时提交（每 tick 一次快照，归属清晰）
      var cb = e.target.closest('input[data-catval]');
      if (cb) toggleCatValue(cb.dataset.catdim, cb.dataset.catval, '维度轨 · 值勾选');
    });
    document.getElementById('dimRail').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var ap = e.target.closest('[data-applyf]');
      if (ap) {
        var dim = ap.dataset.applyf, d = DIM[dim];
        if (d.type === 'quant') {
          var lo = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rng-' + dim + '-lo').value);
          var hi = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rng-' + dim + '-hi').value);
          if (isNaN(lo) || isNaN(hi) || lo > hi) { toast('区间无效'); return; }
          var dom = DOMAIN[dim];
          if (lo <= dom.lo && hi >= dom.hi) clearFilter(dim, '维度轨 · 区间应用（全域）');
          else setRange(dim, clampV(dim, lo), clampV(dim, hi), '维度轨 · 区间应用');
        }
        return;
      }
      var cl = e.target.closest('[data-clearf]');
      if (cl) clearFilter(cl.dataset.clearf, '维度轨 · 清除按钮');
    });
    document.getElementById('anchorBar').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var chip = e.target.closest('[data-clear-dim]');
      if (chip) clearFilter(chip.dataset.clearDim, '锁点条 · 过滤芯片 ×');
    });
    document.getElementById('canvas').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      if (e.target.closest('#clearAllBtn')) { clearAllFilters(); return; }
      var cell = e.target.closest('[data-cell]');
      if (cell) {
        var ij = cell.dataset.cell.split(',');
        var xv = axisVals(state.x), yv = axisVals(state.y);
        drillCell(yv[+ij[0]], xv[+ij[1]]);
      }
    });
    document.getElementById('canvas').addEventListener('change', function (e) {
      if (e.target.id === 'measureSel') {
        var v = e.target.value;
        if (v === 'count') setMeasure('count', null);
        else { var p = v.split(':'); setMeasure('avg', p[1]); }
      }
    });
    document.getElementById('records').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var row = e.target.closest('[data-rec]');
      if (row) setFocus(row.dataset.rec, '记录列表 · 点击行');
    });
    document.getElementById('trail').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      if (e.target.closest('#undoBtn')) { undo(); return; }
      if (e.target.closest('#redoBtn')) { redo(); return; }
      if (e.target.closest('#baseBtn')) { timeTravel(0); return; }
      var it = e.target.closest('[data-tidx]');
      if (it) timeTravel(+it.dataset.tidx);
    });
    document.getElementById('inspector').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      if (e.target.closest('#clearFocusBtn')) clearFocus();
    });
    document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
      if (!(e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey)) return;
      var k = e.key.toLowerCase();
      if (k === 'z' && !e.shiftKey) { e.preventDefault(); undo(); }
      else if ((k === 'z' && e.shiftKey) || k === 'y') { e.preventDefault(); redo(); }
    });
  }
  function clampV(dim, v) {
    var d = DOMAIN[dim];
    return Math.min(d.hi, Math.max(d.lo, v));
  }

  /* ---------------- 启动 ---------------- */
  function boot(rootEl) {
    state = clone(BASE);
    trail = [{ seq: 0, time: new Date(), action: '初始状态（首屏内联就绪）', source: '系统 · 数据内联', snap: null }];
    state && (trail[0].snap = snapshot());
    bind();
    renderAll();
  }
  if (!window.__HARNESS__) {
    boot(document.getElementById('app'));
  }

  /* 供测试 harness 与调试使用 */
  window.APP = {
    boot: boot,
    /* 只读内部态 */
    get state() { return clone(state); },
    get trail() { return clone(trail.map(function (t) { return { seq: t.seq, time: t.time, action: t.action, source: t.source }; })); },
    get tIndex() { return tIndex; },
    matchingCount: function () { return matching().length; },
    /* 受控动作（带默认归属来源） */
    setAxis: function (a, d) { setAxis(a, d, 'harness'); },
    toggleCatValue: function (d, v) { toggleCatValue(d, v, 'harness'); },
    setRange: function (d, lo, hi) { setRange(d, lo, hi, 'harness'); },
    setFocus: function (id) { setFocus(id, 'harness'); },
    setMeasure: setMeasure,
    drillCell: drillCell,
    timeTravel: timeTravel,
    undo: undo,
    redo: redo,
    clearAllFilters: clearAllFilters
  };
})();

tool_use_result.content:
/* 星巡台 ASTRA · cell-j13-s10 —— 多维数据探索（explore × dimensional-space）
 *
 * 设计契约（Prax 会话 ds_20261023205741_2a9a445c）：
 *  1. 维度切换不重置认知：换轴仅触碰 viewport（投影轴），query(过滤)/selection(聚焦)/
 *     度量/轨迹一律保留 —— projection_model 与 filter_model、focus_model 相互独立。
 *  2. 过滤/投影状态有归属且可回退：每次变更压入完整状态快照（归属 = 触发操作名 +
 *     来源 + 时间戳），轨迹条目即快照引用，点击回退；另配撤销/重做。
 *  3. 首屏即用：数据由 js/data.js 内联，同步初始化，无加载态、无网络请求。
 */
(function () {
  'use strict';

  var S = window.SURVEY;
  var DIM = {};
  S.dims.forEach(function (d) { DIM[d.id] = d; });
  var QUANT = S.dims.filter(function (d) { return d.type === 'quant'; });

  /* ---------------- 工具 ---------------- */
  function clone(o) { return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(o)); }
  function esc(s) {
    return String(s).replace(/[&<>"]/g, function (c) {
      return { '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;' }[c];
    });
  }
  function fmtV(dim, v) {
    var d = DIM[dim];
    if (d.type === 'cat') return String(v);
    var dec = (v >= 1000) ? 0 : d.dec;
    return Number(v).toFixed(dec);
  }
  function ts(d) {
    function p(n) { return (n < 10 ? '0' : '') + n; }
    return p(d.getHours()) + ':' + p(d.getMinutes()) + ':' + p(d.getSeconds());
  }
  function hsl2hex(h, s, l) {
    l /= 100; var a = s * Math.min(l, 1 - l) / 100;
    function f(n) {
      var k = (n + h / 30) % 12;
      var c = l - a * Math.max(Math.min(k - 3, 9 - k, 1), -1);
      return Math.round(255 * c).toString(16).padStart(2, '0');
    }
    return '#' + f(0) + f(8) + f(4);
  }
  /* 热力色标：单色相顺序色（暗底 → 亮青），7 级量化，保证顺序可读（dataviz 惯例） */
  var HEAT = [];
  (function () {
    for (var i = 0; i < 7; i++) {
      var t = i / 6;
      // 从深蓝黑 (#12222e) 插值到亮青 (#59d9c5)
      var c0 = [0x12, 0x22, 0x2e], c1 = [0x59, 0xd9, 0xc5];
      var c = c0.map(function (v, k) { return Math.round(v + (c1[k] - v) * t); });
      HEAT.push({ bg: 'rgb(' + c.join(',') + ')', light: t > 0.55 });
    }
  })();

  /* ---------------- 状态模型 ---------------- */
  var BASE = {
    x: 'method',            // 投影 X 轴（viewport）
    y: 'temp',              // 投影 Y 轴（viewport）
    measure: { kind: 'count', dim: null }, // 度量（投影状态）
    filters: [],            // query：[{dim, kind:'cat', values:[]}|{dim, kind:'range', lo, hi}]
    focus: null             // selection：记录 id
  };
  var state;      // 当前已提交状态
  var trail = []; // [{seq, time, action, source, snap}] —— 快照栈：归属 + 回退
  var tIndex = 0; // 当前所处轨迹位置
  var ui = { openDim: null }; // 纯 UI 态（不进入快照）

  function snapshot() {
    return { x: state.x, y: state.y, measure: clone(state.measure), filters: clone(state.filters), focus: state.focus };
  }

  /* 每次过滤/投影变更统一走 commit：压入快照，归属 = action + source + time */
  function commit(action, source, mutate) {
    trail = trail.slice(0, tIndex + 1); // 丢弃重做分支
    mutate();
    trail.push({ seq: trail.length, time: new Date(), action: action, source: source, snap: snapshot() });
    tIndex = trail.length - 1;
    renderAll();
  }
  function timeTravel(i) {
    if (i < 0 || i >= trail.length || i === tIndex) return;
    tIndex = i;
    state = clone(trail[i].snap);
    renderAll();
  }
  function undo() { timeTravel(tIndex - 1); }
  function redo() { timeTravel(tIndex + 1); }

  function filterOf(dim) {
    for (var i = 0; i < state.filters.length; i++) if (state.filters[i].dim === dim) return state.filters[i];
    return null;
  }
  function matching() {
    return S.records.filter(function (r) {
      for (var i = 0; i < state.filters.length; i++) {
        var f = state.filters[i], v = r[f.dim];
        if (f.kind === 'cat') { if (f.values.indexOf(v) < 0) return false; }
        else { if (v < f.lo || v > f.hi) return false; }
      }
      return true;
    });
  }

  /* 数量维度：固定分箱（全域 8 箱）—— 过滤/换轴后参照系不变，认知不漂移 */
  var DOMAIN = {};
  QUANT.forEach(function (d) {
    var lo = Infinity, hi = -Infinity;
    S.records.forEach(function (r) { lo = Math.min(lo, r[d.id]); hi = Math.max(hi, r[d.id]); });
    DOMAIN[d.id] = { lo: lo, hi: hi, n: 8 };
  });
  function binOf(dim, v) {
    var d = DOMAIN[dim];
    return Math.min(d.n - 1, Math.max(0, Math.floor((v - d.lo) / (d.hi - d.lo) * d.n)));
  }
  function binLabel(dim, i) {
    var d = DOMAIN[dim], w = (d.hi - d.lo) / d.n;
    var a = d.lo + i * w, b = a + w;
    return fmtV(dim, a) + '–' + fmtV(dim, b);
  }
  function axisVals(dim) {
    if (DIM[dim].type === 'cat') return DIM[dim].values.slice();
    var out = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < DOMAIN[dim].n; i++) out.push({ bin: i });
    return out;
  }
  function axisIndexOf(dim, v) {
    return DIM[dim].type === 'cat' ? DIM[dim].values.indexOf(v) : binOf(dim, v);
  }

  /* ---------------- 交互动作 ---------------- */
  /* 换轴：只动 viewport —— 过滤、聚焦、度量、轨迹原样保留（成功标准的实现点） */
  function setAxis(axis, dim, source) {
    var target = axis === 'x' ? 'x' : 'y', other = axis === 'x' ? 'y' : 'x';
    var swapped = false;
    commit('换轴 ' + target.toUpperCase() + ' → ' + DIM[dim].label, source || '维度轨 · 点击', function () {
      if (state[other] === dim) { state[other] = state[target]; swapped = true; }
      state[target] = dim;
    });
    toast(swapped ? '已对调两轴 · 过滤 ' + state.filters.length + ' 项、聚焦与轨迹全部保留'
                  : '维度已切换 · 过滤 ' + state.filters.length + ' 项、聚焦与轨迹全部保留');
  }
  function setMeasure(kind, dim) {
    var label = kind === 'count' ? '计数' : '平均 · ' + DIM[dim].label;
    commit('度量 → ' + label, '投影画布 · 度量选择', function () {
      state.measure = kind === 'count' ? { kind: 'count', dim: null } : { kind: 'avg', dim: dim };
    });
  }
  function drillCell(yVal, xVal) {
    var targets = [];
    [[state.x, xVal], [state.y, yVal]].forEach(function (p) {
      var dim = p[0], v = p[1], cur = filterOf(dim);
      if (DIM[dim].type === 'cat') {
        var same = cur && cur.values.length === 1 && cur.values[0] === v;
        if (!same) targets.push({ dim: dim, kind: 'cat', values: [v] });
      } else {
        var d = DOMAIN[dim], w = (d.hi - d.lo) / d.n, i = v.bin;
        var lo = d.lo + i * w, hi = d.lo + (i + 1) * w;
        var same2 = cur && cur.kind === 'range' && cur.lo === lo && cur.hi === hi;
        if (!same2) targets.push({ dim: dim, kind: 'range', lo: lo, hi: hi });
      }
    });
    if (!targets.length) { toast('该单元格已被当前过滤覆盖'); return; }
    var desc = targets.map(function (t) { return DIM[t.dim].label + '=' + (t.kind === 'cat' ? t.values[0] : binLabel(t.dim, Math.floor((t.lo - DOMAIN[t.dim].lo) / ((DOMAIN[t.dim].hi - DOMAIN[t.dim].lo) / DOMAIN[t.dim].n)))); }).join(' 且 ');
    commit('下钻 [' + desc + ']', '投影画布 · 单元格点击', function () {
      targets.forEach(function (t) {
        var k = state.filters.findIndex(function (f) { return f.dim === t.dim; });
        if (k >= 0) state.filters[k] = t; else state.filters.push(t);
      });
    });
  }
  function toggleCatValue(dim, val, source) {
    var f = filterOf(dim);
    var had = !!(f && f.values.indexOf(val) >= 0);
    commit((had ? '解除过滤 ' : '过滤 ') + DIM[dim].label + '=' + val, source, function () {
      var cur = filterOf(dim);
      if (!cur) { state.filters.push({ dim: dim, kind: 'cat', values: [val] }); return; }
      var vals = cur.values.slice(), k = vals.indexOf(val);
      if (k >= 0) {
        vals.splice(k, 1);
        if (!vals.length) state.filters = state.filters.filter(function (x) { return x.dim !== dim; });
        else cur.values = vals;
      } else { vals.push(val); cur.values = vals; }
    });
  }
  function setRange(dim, lo, hi, source) {
    commit('过滤 ' + DIM[dim].label + ' ∈ [' + fmtV(dim, lo) + ', ' + fmtV(dim, hi) + ']', source, function () {
      var f = filterOf(dim);
      if (f) { f.kind = 'range'; f.lo = lo; f.hi = hi; delete f.values; }
      else state.filters.push({ dim: dim, kind: 'range', lo: lo, hi: hi });
    });
  }
  function clearFilter(dim, source) {
    commit('解除 ' + DIM[dim].label + ' 过滤', source, function () {
      state.filters = state.filters.filter(function (f) { return f.dim !== dim; });
    });
  }
  function clearAllFilters() {
    commit('清除全部过滤（' + state.filters.length + ' 项）', '投影画布 · 空状态恢复', function () {
      state.filters = [];
    });
  }
  function setFocus(id, source) {
    var r = recById(id);
    if (state.focus === id) return;
    var wasNull = !state.focus;
    commit((wasNull ? '聚焦 ' : '切换聚焦 ') + r.name, source, function () { state.focus = id; });
  }
  function clearFocus() {
    commit('清除聚焦', '检查器 · 操作', function () { state.focus = null; });
  }
  function recById(id) {
    for (var i = 0; i < S.records.length; i++) if (S.records[i].id === id) return S.records[i];
    return null;
  }

  /* ---------------- toast ---------------- */
  var toastTimer = null;
  function toast(msg) {
    var t = document.getElementById('toast');
    t.textContent = msg;
    t.hidden = false;
    requestAnimationFrame(function () { t.classList.add('show'); });
    clearTimeout(toastTimer);
    toastTimer = setTimeout(function () {
      t.classList.remove('show');
      toastTimer = setTimeout(function () { t.hidden = true; }, 300);
    }, 2000);
  }

  /* ---------------- 渲染 ---------------- */
  function renderAll() {
    renderAnchor();
    renderRail();
    renderCanvas();
    renderRecords();
    renderTrail();
    renderInspector();
  }

  /* 认知锁点条：跨维度切换恒定的锚点（H-21 定向不变量的可见化） */
  function renderAnchor() {
    var nF = state.filters.length;
    var fRec = state.focus ? recById(state.focus) : null;
    var mLabel = state.measure.kind === 'count' ? '计数' : '平均 · ' + DIM[state.measure.dim].label;
    var html = '';
    html += '<span class="chip dim-keep" title="投影轴：跨维度切换由你主动更换，此处恒定显示当前轴">投影 <b>' + esc(DIM[state.y].label) + '</b><span class="k">×</span><b>' + esc(DIM[state.x].label) + '</b></span>';
    html += '<span class="chip dim-keep" title="度量选择不随换轴重置">度量 <b>' + esc(mLabel) + '</b></span>';
    html += '<span class="chip" title="当前过滤下的记录数（总数恒定）"><span class="k">匹配</span><b>' + matching().length + '</b><span class="k">/ ' + S.records.length + '</span></span>';
    if (fRec) html += '<span class="chip focus-chip" title="聚焦记录跨维度切换保持锚定">聚焦 <b>' + esc(fRec.name) + '</b></span>';
    else html += '<span class="chip" title="尚未聚焦记录；聚焦后同样跨维度切换保持"><span class="k">聚焦</span>无</span>';
    html += '<span class="chip" title="状态轨迹深度：归属与回退见状态轨迹面板"><span class="k">轨迹</span><b>' + (tIndex + 1) + '</b><span class="k">/ ' + trail.length + '</span></span>';
    state.filters.forEach(function (f) {
      var owner = ownerOf(f.dim);
      var label = DIM[f.dim].label + ' = ' + (f.kind === 'cat' ? f.values.join('∣') : '[' + fmtV(f.dim, f.lo) + ', ' + fmtV(f.dim, f.hi) + ']');
      html += '<span class="chip filter-chip" data-clear-dim="' + f.dim + '" title="归属：' + esc(owner.action) + ' · ' + esc(owner.time) + '（点击移除，可经轨迹回退恢复）">' + esc(label) + '<span class="x" aria-label="移除过滤">×</span></span>';
    });
    document.getElementById('anchorBar').innerHTML = html;
  }
  /* 归属查询：找到引入/最后更新该维度过滤的轨迹条目 */
  function ownerOf(dim) {
    for (var i = trail.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
      var a = trail[i].action;
      if (a.indexOf(DIM[dim].label) >= 0 && (a.indexOf('过滤') === 0 || a.indexOf('下钻') === 0 || a.indexOf('解除') === 0 || a.indexOf('清除') === 0))
        return { action: a, time: ts(trail[i].time) };
    }
    return { action: '初始状态', time: ts(trail[0].time) };
  }

  function renderRail() {
    var fams = {};
    S.dims.forEach(function (d) { (fams[d.family] = fams[d.family] || []).push(d); });
    var html = '';
    Object.keys(fams).forEach(function (fam) {
      html += '<div class="rail-title">' + esc(fam) + '</div>';
      fams[fam].forEach(function (d) {
        var onX = state.x === d.id, onY = state.y === d.id;
        var f = filterOf(d.id);
        html += '<div class="dim' + (onX ? ' on-x' : '') + (onY ? ' on-y' : '') + (f ? ' filtered' : '') + '">';
        html += '<div class="dim-head">';
        html += '<button class="ax' + (onX ? ' x-active' : '') + '" data-axis="x" data-dim="' + d.id + '" title="设为 X 轴（列）' + (onY ? '；当前为 Y 轴，点击将对调' : '') + '">X</button>';
        html += '<button class="ax' + (onY ? ' y-active' : '') + '" data-axis="y" data-dim="' + d.id + '" title="设为 Y 轴（行）' + (onX ? '；当前为 X 轴，点击将对调' : '') + '">Y</button>';
        html += '<span class="dim-name">' + esc(d.label) + (d.unit ? ' <i style="font-style:normal;color:var(--tx3)">(' + d.unit + ')</i>' : '') + '</span>';
        html += '<span class="badge ' + d.type + '">' + (d.type === 'cat' ? '类' : '量') + '</span>';
        html += '<button class="funnel' + (f ? ' has-f' : '') + '" data-funnel="' + d.id + '" title="过滤此维度">◮' + (f ? '<sub>' + (f.kind === 'cat' ? f.values.length : '∈') + '</sub>' : '') + '</button>';
        html += '</div>';
        html += sparkline(d.id);
        if (ui.openDim === d.id) html += filterEditor(d.id);
        html += '</div>';
      });
    });
    var rail = document.getElementById('dimRail');
    rail.innerHTML = html;
  }
  function sparkline(dim) {
    var d = DIM[dim], vals;
    if (d.type === 'cat') {
      vals = d.values.map(function (v) {
        return S.records.reduce(function (s, r) { return s + (r[dim] === v ? 1 : 0); }, 0);
      });
    } else {
      vals = new Array(DOMAIN[dim].n).fill(0);
      S.records.forEach(function (r) { vals[binOf(dim, r[dim])]++; });
    }
    var max = Math.max.apply(null, vals);
    var bars = vals.map(function (v) {
      var h = max ? Math.max(1.5, v / max * 22) : 1.5;
      return '<rect height="' + h.toFixed(1) + '" width="' + (100 / vals.length - 1.2) + '" x="' + (vals.indexOf(v) === -1 ? 0 : vals.indexOf(v)) + '" y="' + (24 - h).toFixed(1) + '"></rect>';
    });
    // 上面 indexOf 技巧在重复值时不可靠，改为索引循环
    bars = vals.map(function (v, i) {
      var h = max ? Math.max(1.5, v / max * 22) : 1.5;
      return '<rect height="' + h.toFixed(1) + '" width="' + (100 / vals.length - 1.2).toFixed(2) + '" x="' + (i * 100 / vals.length).toFixed(2) + '" y="' + (24 - h).toFixed(1) + '"></rect>';
    }).join('');
    return '<svg class="spark" viewBox="0 0 100 24" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">' + bars + '</svg>';
  }
  function filterEditor(dim) {
    var d = DIM[dim], f = filterOf(dim), html = '<div class="dim-edit">';
    if (d.type === 'cat') {
      html += '<div class="vals">';
      d.values.forEach(function (v) {
        var n = S.records.reduce(function (s, r) { return s + (r[dim] === v ? 1 : 0); }, 0);
        var on = f && f.values.indexOf(v) >= 0;
        html += '<label class="val"><input type="checkbox" data-catval="' + esc(v) + '" data-catdim="' + dim + '"' + (on ? ' checked' : '') + '> ' + esc(v) + '<span class="cnt">' + n + '</span></label>';
      });
      html += '</div>';
    } else {
      var lo = f ? f.lo : DOMAIN[dim].lo, hi = f ? f.hi : DOMAIN[dim].hi;
      html += '<div class="range-row"><input type="number" id="rng-' + dim + '-lo" value="' + lo + '" step="any" aria-label="最小值"> <span style="color:var(--tx3)">–</span> <input type="number" id="rng-' + dim + '-hi" value="' + hi + '" step="any" aria-label="最大值"></div>';
    }
    html += '<div class="mini-actions">';
    html += '<button class="btn primary" data-applyf="' + dim + '">应用过滤</button>';
    if (f) html += '<button class="btn ghost" data-clearf="' + dim + '">清除</button>';
    html += '</div></div>';
    return html;
  }

  function renderCanvas() {
    var el = document.getElementById('canvas');
    var xv = axisVals(state.x), yv = axisVals(state.y);
    var rows = matching();
    var mLabel = state.measure.kind === 'count' ? '计数' : '平均 · ' + DIM[state.measure.dim].label;

    var head = '<div class="canvas-head">';
    head += '<span class="canvas-title"><span class="yd">' + esc(DIM[state.y].label) + '</span><span class="arr">╲</span><span class="xd">' + esc(DIM[state.x].label) + '</span></span>';
    head += '<span class="canvas-note">单元格点击 = 下钻为过滤（归属并记入轨迹）· 换轴不改变过滤 / 聚焦 / 度量</span>';
    head += '<span class="measure-wrap">度量 <select id="measureSel" aria-label="度量选择">';
    head += '<option value="count"' + (state.measure.kind === 'count' ? ' selected' : '') + '>计数</option>';
    QUANT.forEach(function (d) {
      head += '<option value="avg:' + d.id + '"' + (state.measure.kind === 'avg' && state.measure.dim === d.id ? ' selected' : '') + '>平均 · ' + esc(d.label) + (d.unit ? '(' + d.unit + ')' : '') + '</option>';
    });
    head += '</select>';
    // 图例
    head += '<span class="legend" title="热力色标：低 → 高">';
    for (var li = 0; li < 7; li++) head += '<i style="background:' + HEAT[li].bg + '"></i>';
    head += '</span></span></div>';

    if (!rows.length) {
      el.innerHTML = head + '<div class="empty-state"><span class="glyph">◌</span>' +
        '<p>当前过滤组合下没有匹配记录（空集）。<br>过滤与投影状态仍被完整记录与保留。</p>' +
        '<button class="btn primary" id="clearAllBtn">清除全部过滤（' + state.filters.length + ' 项）</button></div>';
      return;
    }

    // 聚合
    var useAvg = state.measure.kind === 'avg', mDim = state.measure.dim;
    var cnt = [], agg = [], rowTot = [], colTot = new Array(xv.length).fill(0);
    var mVal = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < yv.length; i++) {
      cnt.push(new Array(xv.length).fill(0));
      mVal.push(new Array(xv.length).fill(0));
      rowTot.push(0);
    }
    var colAgg = new Array(xv.length).fill(0);
    rows.forEach(function (r) {
      var j = axisIndexOf(state.x, r[state.x]);
      var i2 = axisIndexOf(state.y, r[state.y]);
      cnt[i2][j]++; rowTot[i2]++; colTot[j]++;
      if (useAvg) { mVal[i2][j] += r[mDim]; colAgg[j] += r[mDim]; }
    });
    var cellDisp = cnt.map(function (row, i2) {
      return row.map(function (c, j) {
        if (!c) return null;
        return useAvg ? mVal[i2][j] / c : c;
      });
    });
    var maxCell = 0;
    cellDisp.forEach(function (row) { row.forEach(function (v) { if (v !== null) maxCell = Math.max(maxCell, v); }); });
    function heatLevel(v) { return Math.min(6, Math.floor(v / (maxCell || 1) * 6.999)); }

    var fRec = state.focus ? recById(state.focus) : null;
    var focusCell = null;
    if (fRec) focusCell = [axisIndexOf(state.y, fRec[state.y]), axisIndexOf(state.x, fRec[state.x])];

    var html = head + '<table class="heat"><thead><tr><th class="corner">' + esc(DIM[state.y].label) + ' ╲ ' + esc(DIM[state.x].label) + '</th>';
    xv.forEach(function (v, j) {
      var lab = DIM[state.x].type === 'cat' ? v : binLabel(state.x, v.bin);
      html += '<th' + (state.xIsQuantCol ? '' : '') + ' class="' + (state.x === state.measure.dim && useAvg ? 'x-active-col' : '') + '" title="' + esc(lab) + '">' + esc(lab) + '</th>';
    });
    html += '<th class="margin">Σ</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
    yv.forEach(function (v, i2) {
      var lab = DIM[state.y].type === 'cat' ? v : binLabel(state.y, v.bin);
      html += '<tr><th class="' + (state.y === state.measure.dim && useAvg ? 'y-active-row' : '') + '" title="' + esc(lab) + '">' + esc(lab) + '</th>';
      xv.forEach(function (_, j) {
        var c = cnt[i2][j];
        var cls = 'cell' + (!c ? ' zero' : '');
        var style = '';
        if (c) {
          var hl = heatLevel(cellDisp[i2][j]);
          style = 'background:' + HEAT[hl].bg;
          if (HEAT[hl].light) cls += ' hot-tx';
        }
        if (focusCell && focusCell[0] === i2 && focusCell[1] === j) cls += ' focus-cell';
        var big = c === 0 ? '·' : (useAvg ? fmtV(mDim, cellDisp[i2][j]) : c);
        var sub = c === 0 ? '' : (useAvg ? 'n=' + c : '');
        html += '<td class="' + cls + '" style="' + style + '" data-cell="' + i2 + ',' + j + '" title="' + esc(DIM[state.y].label) + '×' + esc(DIM[state.x].label) + ': n=' + c + (c && useAvg ? ', avg=' + fmtV(mDim, cellDisp[i2][j]) : '') + '（点击下钻）">' +
          '<span class="big">' + big + '</span>' + (sub ? '<span class="sub">' + sub + '</span>' : '') + '</td>';
      });
      html += '<td class="margin">' + rowTot[i2] + '</td></tr>';
    });
    html += '<tr><th class="margin" style="text-align:right">Σ</th>';
    xv.forEach(function (_, j) { html += '<td class="margin">' + colTot[j] + '</td>'; });
    html += '<td class="margin">' + rows.length + '</td></tr></tbody></table>';
    el.innerHTML = html;
  }

  function renderRecords() {
    var el = document.getElementById('records');
    var rows = matching();
    var html = '<div class="panel-h">匹配记录<span class="cnt">' + rows.length + ' / ' + S.records.length + '</span></div>';
    html += '<div class="rec-head"><span>名称 / 类别</span><span>温度 K</span><span>距离 ly</span><span>ESI</span></div>';
    html += '<div class="panel-b">';
    var LIMIT = 60;
    rows.slice(0, LIMIT).forEach(function (r) {
      var cur = state.focus === r.id;
      html += '<div class="rec-row' + (cur ? ' current' : '') + '" data-rec="' + r.id + '" title="点击聚焦（跨维度切换保持）">' +
        '<span class="rec-name">' + esc(r.name) + '<span class="rec-sub">' + esc(r.pclass) + ' · ' + esc(r.star) + '</span></span>' +
        '<span class="rec-num">' + r.temp + '</span><span class="rec-num">' + r.dist + '</span><span class="rec-num">' + r.esi.toFixed(2) + '</span></div>';
    });
    html += '</div>';
    if (rows.length > LIMIT) html += '<div class="rec-foot">仅显示前 ' + LIMIT + ' 条（按宜居指数序），共 ' + rows.length + ' 条匹配</div>';
    el.innerHTML = html;
  }

  function renderTrail() {
    var el = document.getElementById('trail');
    var html = '<div class="panel-h">状态轨迹 · 归属与回退' +
      '<span style="margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:4px">' +
      '<button class="btn" id="undoBtn" title="撤销（Ctrl+Z）"' + (tIndex > 0 ? '' : ' disabled') + '>↶</button>' +
      '<button class="btn" id="redoBtn" title="重做（Ctrl+Shift+Z）"' + (tIndex < trail.length - 1 ? '' : ' disabled') + '>↷</button>' +
      '<button class="btn" id="baseBtn" title="回到初始状态"' + (tIndex > 0 ? '' : ' disabled') + '>⤺</button>' +
      '</span></div>';
    html += '<div class="trail-hint">每条 = 一个完整状态快照（归属：触发操作 + 来源 + 时间）。点击任意条目回退到该时刻；之后的操作会开新分支。</div>';
    html += '<div class="trail-list">';
    for (var i = trail.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
      var t = trail[i];
      var cls = 'trail-item' + (i === tIndex ? ' current' : '') + (i < tIndex ? ' past' : '');
      html += '<div class="' + cls + '" data-tidx="' + i + '" title="点击回退到该状态">' +
        '<span class="trail-seq">#' + t.seq + '</span>' +
        '<span class="trail-act"><span class="a">' + esc(t.action) + '</span><span class="src">归属：' + esc(t.source) + '</span></span>' +
        '<span class="trail-time">' + ts(t.time) + '</span></div>';
    }
    html += '</div>';
    el.innerHTML = html;
  }

  function renderInspector() {
    var el = document.getElementById('inspector');
    var r = state.focus ? recById(state.focus) : null;
    if (!r) {
      el.innerHTML = '<div class="panel-h">聚焦检查器</div><div class="insp-empty">尚未聚焦记录。点击画布下方的记录列表，或在投影中下钻后选择一条行星；聚焦会<b style="color:var(--tx2)">跨维度切换保持</b>，其投影落点随当前轴自动更新。</div>';
      return;
    }
    var html = '<div class="panel-h">聚焦检查器<span class="cnt">' + esc(r.id) + '</span></div><div class="insp-body">';
    html += '<div class="insp-name">' + esc(r.name) + '</div>';
    html += '<div class="insp-sub">' + esc(r.pclass) + ' · ' + esc(r.method) + ' · ' + esc(r.star) + ' · ' + esc(r.sky) + '</div>';
    html += '<div class="insp-grid">';
    QUANT.forEach(function (d) {
      html += '<div class="insp-kv"><span class="k">' + esc(d.label) + (d.unit ? '(' + d.unit + ')' : '') + '</span><span class="v">' + fmtV(d.id, r[d.id]) + '</span></div>';
    });
    html += '</div>';
    var xLab = DIM[state.x].type === 'cat' ? r[state.x] : binLabel(state.x, binOf(state.x, r[state.x]));
    var yLab = DIM[state.y].type === 'cat' ? r[state.y] : binLabel(state.y, binOf(state.y, r[state.y]));
    html += '<div class="insp-pos">当前投影落点：<b>' + esc(DIM[state.y].label) + '</b>=' + esc(yLab) + ' × <b>' + esc(DIM[state.x].label) + '</b>=' + esc(xLab) + '<br><span style="color:var(--tx3)">换轴后此行随当前投影自动更新，聚焦本身不丢失。</span></div>';
    html += '<div class="mini-actions"><button class="btn" id="clearFocusBtn">清除聚焦</button></div></div>';
    el.innerHTML = html;
  }

  /* ---------------- 事件绑定 ---------------- */
  function bind() {
    document.getElementById('dimRail').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var ax = e.target.closest('.ax');
      if (ax) { setAxis(ax.dataset.axis, ax.dataset.dim, '维度轨 · ' + ax.dataset.axis.toUpperCase() + ' 轴按钮'); return; }
      var fn = e.target.closest('.funnel');
      if (fn) { ui.openDim = ui.openDim === fn.dataset.funnel ? null : fn.dataset.funnel; renderRail(); }
    });
    document.getElementById('dimRail').addEventListener('change', function (e) {
      // 分类复选框即时提交（每 tick 一次快照，归属清晰）
      var cb = e.target.closest('input[data-catval]');
      if (cb) toggleCatValue(cb.dataset.catdim, cb.dataset.catval, '维度轨 · 值勾选');
    });
    document.getElementById('dimRail').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var ap = e.target.closest('[data-applyf]');
      if (ap) {
        var dim = ap.dataset.applyf, d = DIM[dim];
        if (d.type === 'quant') {
          var lo = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rng-' + dim + '-lo').value);
          var hi = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rng-' + dim + '-hi').value);
          if (isNaN(lo) || isNaN(hi) || lo > hi) { toast('区间无效'); return; }
          var dom = DOMAIN[dim];
          if (lo <= dom.lo && hi >= dom.hi) clearFilter(dim, '维度轨 · 区间应用（全域）');
          else setRange(dim, clampV(dim, lo), clampV(dim, hi), '维度轨 · 区间应用');
        }
        return;
      }
      var cl = e.target.closest('[data-clearf]');
      if (cl) clearFilter(cl.dataset.clearf, '维度轨 · 清除按钮');
    });
    document.getElementById('anchorBar').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var chip = e.target.closest('[data-clear-dim]');
      if (chip) clearFilter(chip.dataset.clearDim, '锁点条 · 过滤芯片 ×');
    });
    document.getElementById('canvas').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      if (e.target.closest('#clearAllBtn')) { clearAllFilters(); return; }
      var cell = e.target.closest('[data-cell]');
      if (cell) {
        var ij = cell.dataset.cell.split(',');
        var xv = axisVals(state.x), yv = axisVals(state.y);
        drillCell(yv[+ij[0]], xv[+ij[1]]);
      }
    });
    document.getElementById('canvas').addEventListener('change', function (e) {
      if (e.target.id === 'measureSel') {
        var v = e.target.value;
        if (v === 'count') setMeasure('count', null);
        else { var p = v.split(':'); setMeasure('avg', p[1]); }
      }
    });
    document.getElementById('records').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var row = e.target.closest('[data-rec]');
      if (row) setFocus(row.dataset.rec, '记录列表 · 点击行');
    });
    document.getElementById('trail').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      if (e.target.closest('#undoBtn')) { undo(); return; }
      if (e.target.closest('#redoBtn')) { redo(); return; }
      if (e.target.closest('#baseBtn')) { timeTravel(0); return; }
      var it = e.target.closest('[data-tidx]');
      if (it) timeTravel(+it.dataset.tidx);
    });
    document.getElementById('inspector').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      if (e.target.closest('#clearFocusBtn')) clearFocus();
    });
    document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
      if (!(e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey)) return;
      var k = e.key.toLowerCase();
      if (k === 'z' && !e.shiftKey) { e.preventDefault(); undo(); }
      else if ((k === 'z' && e.shiftKey) || k === 'y') { e.preventDefault(); redo(); }
    });
  }
  function clampV(dim, v) {
    var d = DOMAIN[dim];
    return Math.min(d.hi, Math.max(d.lo, v));
  }

  /* ---------------- 启动 ---------------- */
  function boot(rootEl) {
    state = clone(BASE);
    trail = [{ seq: 0, time: new Date(), action: '初始状态（首屏内联就绪）', source: '系统 · 数据内联', snap: null }];
    state && (trail[0].snap = snapshot());
    bind();
    renderAll();
  }
  if (!window.__HARNESS__) {
    boot(document.getElementById('app'));
  }

  /* 供测试 harness 与调试使用 */
  window.APP = {
    boot: boot,
    /* 只读内部态 */
    get state() { return clone(state); },
    get trail() { return clone(trail.map(function (t) { return { seq: t.seq, time: t.time, action: t.action, source: t.source }; })); },
    get tIndex() { return tIndex; },
    matchingCount: function () { return matching().length; },
    /* 受控动作（带默认归属来源） */
    setAxis: function (a, d) { setAxis(a, d, 'harness'); },
    toggleCatValue: function (d, v) { toggleCatValue(d, v, 'harness'); },
    setRange: function (d, lo, hi) { setRange(d, lo, hi, 'harness'); },
    setFocus: function (id) { setFocus(id, 'harness'); },
    setMeasure: setMeasure,
    drillCell: drillCell,
    timeTravel: timeTravel,
    undo: undo,
    redo: redo,
    clearAllFilters: clearAllFilters
  };
})();

